; The records of `cname.example.test` (a chain of ten and a loop) on the lab's authority node (round `recursion` of smoke.sh,
; README.md). The SOA and the apex NS set (a.root.test.) come from the zone's creation
; through the API; this file is imported into the zone with POST .../records/import.
$ORIGIN cname.example.test.
$TTL 3600
c1                   300 CNAME c2
c2                   300 CNAME c3
c3                   300 CNAME c4
c4                   300 CNAME c5
c5                   300 CNAME c6
c6                   300 CNAME c7
c7                   300 CNAME c8
c8                   300 CNAME c9
c9                   300 CNAME c10
c10                  300 CNAME end
end                  300 A 192.0.2.32
short                300 CNAME end
loop1                300 CNAME loop2
loop2                300 CNAME loop1
